Waterfox (musl + Wayland) build pipeline
Copyright (c) 2026 vr-ski

This repository builds an unofficial binary of Waterfox from the Waterfox
source tree published by BrowserWorks, with the patches in `patches/`
applied. The patched source tree used to produce released binaries can be
reconstructed by applying those patches to the upstream commit recorded
in the `UPSTREAM_COMMIT` file at the root of this repository.

